{"aliases":["Semantic ID","Semantic IDs","语义 ID","语义 ID 物料 token"],"external_ids":{},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-11-09T04:14:56.248137+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"seed: 实习/竞赛项目整理补技术节点（异常检测、生成式推荐、提示词优化、VLM grounding）","op":"insert","reason":"VAE 是生成模型，语义 ID 是用 RQ-VAE 得到的物料编码","run_id":"r_20261109_t6ghyf"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-11-09T04:14:56.248137+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261109_t6ghyf","expanded_at":null,"how":null,"id":"n_01m6z88bsxfyhz4e8t","importance":3,"kind":"method","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"Semantic ID","name_zh":"语义 ID","occurred_at":null,"props":{},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T04:14:56.316102+00:00","slug":"semantic-id","status":"active","summary":"把每个物料编码成一串有语义层次的离散码字，作为生成式推荐里的物料标识。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-09T04:14:56.248137+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261109_t6ghyf","what":"用残差量化自编码器（RQ-VAE）把物料内容嵌入逐层量化成码字元组，相似物料共享前缀码字。","why":"随机物料 ID 之间没有语义联系，新物料和长尾物料学不到；而让模型直接输出上亿个原子 ID 的词表不可行。层次化码字让词表很小，又让相似物料在码字空间里靠近，能泛化到冷启动物料。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-11-09T04:14:56.248137+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m6z88bvhnahjxnqn","other_id":"n_01m6z88bsxgxpdt5gz","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Generative Recommendation","other_name_zh":"生成式推荐","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"generative-recommendation","other_summary":"用序列模型自回归地生成下一个物料的标识来做召回，替代向量近邻检索。","rationale":"TIGER 用语义 ID 作为物料标识，模型预测下一个物料的语义 ID。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Recommender Systems with Generative Retrieval","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.05065"}],"type":"uses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}],"sources":[{"field":null,"published_at":"2023-05-08","publisher":"arXiv","quote":null,"title":"Recommender Systems with Generative Retrieval","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.05065"}],"topics":[{